  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes House and Land Package featuring a Custom design.\r\n\r\nGet your foot on the property ladder with this brand-new 3-bedroom house and land package in sought-after Ara Hills. Designed for easy living, it features modern open-plan spaces, quality finishes, and a low-maintenance section. Enjoy the best of the Hibiscus Coast with Orewa Beach, shops, schools, and motorway access all close by. A fantastic opportunity for first home buyers to secure a stylish new home in a thriving community.\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\n*Price is an indication only and includes land. Some conditions may apply. Image is artist’s impression only.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
